  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43519dac5dcfd4596f83d16a418a37b30fbd413c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/43519dac5dcfd4596f83d16a418a37b30fbd413c\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"2252\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">다양한 생장등이 많은데<br>usb로 꽂으면 파워가 들어와서<br>노트북에서 연결이 좋더라구요 <br>2만원 정도합니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/13dd295907b7d8395609073d9ddfbf83898f1429\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/13dd295907b7d8395609073d9ddfbf83898f1429\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"2252\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">밤에 아파트에 방을 보면 어떤 방이 이런 색이지?<br>무슨 색?  보라색이요~~<br>노노 자홍색!<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce174775b453401b183ce897f7921b8839c20905\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce174775b453401b183ce897f7921b8839c20905\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"2252\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">LED 가 빨파로 되어 있는 것 까지<br>아주 잘보입니다. <br><br>빨간색이 많은 건 아래 이유라네요<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/09521d31ff013613e7fd7503dbbd76d84aa11202\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/09521d31ff013613e7fd7503dbbd76d84aa11202\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2111\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85e092de5f8a92ad82a9ba2772f632f1b86cdd77\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/85e092de5f8a92ad82a9ba2772f632f1b86cdd77\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"2111\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">초록색인 풀이 초록을 반사하고<br>빨파를 흡수해<br>생장등을 자홍을 쓴다는 내용이<br>딱 중2 빛과 파동과 식물의 에너지를 융합하기 좋네요.<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
